            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0046" n="38" xml:id="pg38"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.4131/1668: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kennedy</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-07-14T19:00:00+01:00">July 14, 1938—7
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 14—2:34 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>636. Had dinner with Oliver Stanley last night. He said he understood trade
                    agreement was fairly well settled with the exception of five or six points. I
                    said I have not been so advised.</p>
                <p>Everybody is planning to get out of town by the 29th of July. Is there anything I
                    can do on this?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kennedy</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
